/// Synthetic DAX user-defined functions; bodies are read back verbatim.
function fx_double = ```
		(v:expr) => v * 2
		```
	lineageTag: 9dd8b955-918c-4663-94a9-be03232adb1a

/// Picks the first argument when positive.
function fx_pick = ```
		(a:expr, b:expr) =>
		IF.EAGER(
		    a,
		    b
		)
		```
	lineageTag: c8d385f5-b9e3-4498-9ed8-044c44165ccb
